            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "●Easy operation method<br />\r\nOperate the brake lever with the up and down arrows (↑ &amp; ↓) on the keyboard, accelerate with the Z key, decelerate with the X key, hold the mascone handle at C, reverse key to advance with the S key, gear to reverse with the D key I will change.<br />\r\nYou can rotate the viewpoint with the right mouse drag, and you can return to the original position by left click pressing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Train Simulator Railroad operator is a game that you can operate train with the keyboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEven though trains are very familiar to us, almost all people have no chance to operate trains by themselves.<br />\r\nFor that reason, not a few people seemingly wants to try such experiences.<br />\r\nThose who have wanted to operate a train from your childhood!<br />\r\nYou can now sit and operate train in the motorman's cab that you have dreamed until now!<br />\r\nLet's have a experience in this chance!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Let's operate a train that makes you feel the Showa era! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent Japanese train maneuvering is the lever type, but in the past trains were operated with a mas-con handle and a brake lever. Its operation seems to be complicated, but as you repeat playing, it will lead to the &quot;fun&quot; inherent in railroad games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Always fun no matter how many times you play!! Process from start to game over.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSince it is a good old-fashioned operation method, it takes a lot of time to run a train.<br />\r\n1. Click  at the title screen.<br />\r\n2. Click a stage in STAGE SELECT screen.<br />\r\n3. Click Normal train or Steam train in TRAIN SELECT screen.<br />\r\n4. The game screen is displayed. Keep pressing the up-arrow key, rotate the brake lever to unlock the brake.<br />\r\n5. Hold Z key and rotate the mas-con lever to start moving. To keep the current speed, press C button.<br />\r\n6. By pressing X key, you can move the mas-con lever to the opposite direction and slow down. You can use brake by holding the down-arrow key.<br />\r\n7. To change gear, press D button while brake is working. Train goes back when you unlock the brake and press Z key.<br />\r\n8. After moving backward, apply the brake and press S key to change gear. Unlock the brake and click Z key to go forward.<br />\r\n9. The game is instantly over if the train overruns the platform at station.<br />\r\nWhen you get used to these operations, you should feel exactly &quot;operating a train&quot;. The feeling of immersion increases every time you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n● Thrilling incidents occur one after another!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the train is running, you will be prompted to &quot;lose speed to 35km/h&quot; or &quot;stop by the signal!&quot; on the screen.<br />\r\nPress X key to turn the mas-con lever counterclockwise to decelerate, and hold the down-arrow button to apply brake. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n● We will not arrive at tomorrow just by running.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe event which is indispensable for railway game is &quot;to stop at stations&quot;.<br />\r\nA green line and a red line are drawn at the back of the platform. The green line corresponds with &quot;distance to go&quot;, and you have to stop the train at the point of zero distance to the line.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the railway game that purely expresses the element of &quot;hard but can't stop&quot; that the current game industry has forgotten.",
            "about_the_game": "●Easy operation method<br />\r\nOperate the brake lever with the up and down arrows (↑ &amp; ↓) on the keyboard, accelerate with the Z key, decelerate with the X key, hold the mascone handle at C, reverse key to advance with the S key, gear to reverse with the D key I will change.<br />\r\nYou can rotate the viewpoint with the right mouse drag, and you can return to the original position by left click pressing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Train Simulator Railroad operator is a game that you can operate train with the keyboard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEven though trains are very familiar to us, almost all people have no chance to operate trains by themselves.<br />\r\nFor that reason, not a few people seemingly wants to try such experiences.<br />\r\nThose who have wanted to operate a train from your childhood!<br />\r\nYou can now sit and operate train in the motorman's cab that you have dreamed until now!<br />\r\nLet's have a experience in this chance!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Let's operate a train that makes you feel the Showa era! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent Japanese train maneuvering is the lever type, but in the past trains were operated with a mas-con handle and a brake lever. Its operation seems to be complicated, but as you repeat playing, it will lead to the &quot;fun&quot; inherent in railroad games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●Always fun no matter how many times you play!! Process from start to game over.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSince it is a good old-fashioned operation method, it takes a lot of time to run a train.<br />\r\n1. Click  at the title screen.<br />\r\n2. Click a stage in STAGE SELECT screen.<br />\r\n3. Click Normal train or Steam train in TRAIN SELECT screen.<br />\r\n4. The game screen is displayed. Keep pressing the up-arrow key, rotate the brake lever to unlock the brake.<br />\r\n5. Hold Z key and rotate the mas-con lever to start moving. To keep the current speed, press C button.<br />\r\n6. By pressing X key, you can move the mas-con lever to the opposite direction and slow down. You can use brake by holding the down-arrow key.<br />\r\n7. To change gear, press D button while brake is working. Train goes back when you unlock the brake and press Z key.<br />\r\n8. After moving backward, apply the brake and press S key to change gear. Unlock the brake and click Z key to go forward.<br />\r\n9. The game is instantly over if the train overruns the platform at station.<br />\r\nWhen you get used to these operations, you should feel exactly &quot;operating a train&quot;. The feeling of immersion increases every time you play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n● Thrilling incidents occur one after another!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the train is running, you will be prompted to &quot;lose speed to 35km/h&quot; or &quot;stop by the signal!&quot; on the screen.<br />\r\nPress X key to turn the mas-con lever counterclockwise to decelerate, and hold the down-arrow button to apply brake. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n● We will not arrive at tomorrow just by running.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe event which is indispensable for railway game is &quot;to stop at stations&quot;.<br />\r\nA green line and a red line are drawn at the back of the platform. The green line corresponds with &quot;distance to go&quot;, and you have to stop the train at the point of zero distance to the line.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the railway game that purely expresses the element of &quot;hard but can't stop&quot; that the current game industry has forgotten.",
